What this fork adds
-------------------

A `POST /v1/chat/completions` compatibility surface, so harnesses that only speak Chat
Completions can drive the same ChatGPT Web models the native Codex picker exposes. The
translation runs in-process; there is no second daemon and no extra port.

The rest of the product — browser automation, launcher, tunnel integration, MCP connector,
compaction, model catalog, packaging — is upstream work and is not modified.

